{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"447","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. DZY Loves Hash"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"DZY has a hash table with "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p"},{"kind":"text","text":" buckets, numbered from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":". He wants to insert "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" numbers, in the order they are given, into the hash table. For the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":", DZY will put it into the bucket numbered "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"h(xi)"},{"kind":"text","text":", where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"h(x)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the hash function. In this problem we will assume, that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"h(x) = x mod p"},{"kind":"text","text":". Operation "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a mod b"},{"kind":"text","text":" denotes taking a remainder after division "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"However, each bucket can contain no more than one element. If DZY wants to insert an number into a bucket which is already filled, we say a \"conflict\" happens. Suppose the first conflict happens right after the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th insertion, you should output "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":". If no conflict happens, just output "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(2 ≤ p, n ≤ 300)"},{"kind":"text","text":". Then "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines follow. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of them contains an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(0 ≤ xi ≤ 109)"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer — the answer to the problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10 5\n0\n21\n53\n41\n53\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 5\n0\n1\n2\n3\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"-1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"447A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/447/problem/A"}